Package: lsed
Title: Prevalence-Corrected Evaluation of Species-Distribution Predictions
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("Reed", "Benkendorf",
           email = "reedbenkendorf2021@u.northwestern.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9178-3087"))
Description: Helper functions for evaluating species-distribution model
    predictions at a target landscape prevalence. Provides case weights that
    re-price an evaluation sample to a target prevalence, the
    prevalence-invariant ROC-AUC, average-precision and decision-curve
    net-benefit summaries computed both exactly from point-level predictions
    and from an equal-variance binormal ROC, and Cox calibration of held-out
    predictions.
URL: https://sagesteppe.github.io/lsed/, https://github.com/sagesteppe/lsed
